# ReplayFix Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and insert your API credentials.
# Standard KEY="value", PowerShell `$env:KEY = "value"`, and `export KEY="value"` syntax are all supported:
#
# META_API_KEY="your-meta-api-key"
# $env:META_API_KEY = "your-meta-api-key"
# REPLAYFIX_AI_KEY="your-meta-api-key"
# BASETEN_API_KEY="your-optional-baseten-fallback-key"
#
# Alternatively, persist META_API_KEY globally across all Windows PowerShell sessions & terminals:
#   [Environment]::SetEnvironmentVariable("META_API_KEY", "your-meta-api-key", "User")
